id: pm-cbzvgn
title: "Scorecard alert 29: patch new brace-expansion recursion and rewrite denial-of-service advisories"
description: "Fresh 2026-09-30 Scorecard alert 29 and pnpm audit identify GHSA-6j4f-fj2g-mc7p, GHSA-qhr7-859c-m2p7 and GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr in brace-expansion 5.0.9 via minimatch in ESLint, TypeScript-ESLint and Stryker development tooling. Raise the existing same-major override floor to 5.0.12 and refresh only the affected lock entry, preserving updater cooldowns and all source gates."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[4]: "area:ci",dependency-update,scanner-finding,security
created_at: "2026-09-30T05:40:13.345Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-30T07:08:25.200Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-30T07:08:24.431Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-30T07:08:24.431Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Resolve every brace-expansion edge to at least 5.0.12 within the existing 5.x line; frozen install and full audit succeed; prove the vulnerable boundary and legitimate controls through actual installed public exports; preserve exact full coverage and required static/security/review gates; verify hosted Scorecard closure on the merged head without dismissing the alert.
parent: pm-qwoy
risk: medium
confidence: high
unblock_note: The provenance fixture correction passes 64 focused tests; resume dependency security validation and complete gates.
severity: high
resolution: "Raise the existing brace-expansion override floor and sole reachable lock resolution from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12, retain package integrity/cooldown/compatibility, and register the scanner lineage with full development dependency auditing."
expected_result: "The reviewed development dependency graph uses patched 5.x brace-expansion, preserves ordinary glob behavior and all required source gates, then retires the old-main Scorecard finding after protected merge."
actual_result: "Bounded two-RangeError red cases no longer reproduce on 5.0.12; rewrite control improves from 2289ms to 27ms and all legitimate controls pass. Full/production audits are zero, full coverage is exactly 100/100/100/100 with 9434 passes and two platform skips, canonical static quality passes. Hosted current-head review, protected merge and Scorecard alert 29 retirement are still required delivery observations and are not claimed by this close event."
